# Story progression rules (engine-authoritative)
`state_patch.add_events` only proposes an event. Propose an id only when its trigger is true after this turn's patch and its route lock matches. Rust re-checks every condition and records only fired events.

# Current dramatic beat
mode=Scene. Advance exactly one observable relationship or situation beat at cafe-namu. Do not restart the premise or repeat the last selected approach. End with a concrete new pressure, question, or consequence.

# Autonomous world and NPC initiative
World clock: turn 3 is in the arrival phase; the next pressure is due by turn 4: move the current situation forward. Before offering choices, let the setting or an NPC take one observable initiative; do not wait for the player to invent all momentum.
NPC initiative may create pressure, offer, refusal, departure, or new information, but must not decide the player's response, feelings, speech, or irreversible commitment.

